{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"孙子·life-and-times","stage":"DONE","category":"sun-tzu","categoryLabel":"孙子","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/13_sun-tzu/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生平与时代\">生平与时代</h1><p>本卷回答一个看似简单、实则棘手的问题：<strong>孙武究竟是谁？他从哪里来、做过什么、又有多少是可信的史实？</strong> 孙武（妫姓孙氏，名武，字长卿，约公元前 545—约前 470 年）被尊为「兵圣」，但他的生平史料出奇地稀薄——《史记》本传不足三百字，《左传》详载其参与的柏举之战却不提其名。因此本卷不满足于复述传奇，而是沿着「时代背景 → 仕吴实践 → 史实考辨」三章，既讲述孙武的一生，又随处标明哪些是史实、哪些是传说。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工说明\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工说明</h2><p>孙武主题共六卷，本卷只负责「<strong>这个人</strong>」，不讲他的思想内容与历史影响，以避免重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>负责回答</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>1 生平与时代</strong>（本卷）</td>\n<td>孙武是谁、做过什么、多少可信</td>\n<td>讲人与史实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>孙武在军事思想史上贡献了什么</td>\n<td>讲贡献，不讲生平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>孙武用兵的「操作系统」如何运作</td>\n<td>讲方法内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 代表成就</a></td>\n<td>《孙子兵法》这部书本身</td>\n<td>讲文本结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>这部书的身后影响</td>\n<td>讲传播与遗产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>围绕孙武的争论与总评</td>\n<td>讲争议的完整论证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>特别注意：本卷<a href=\"legend-and-history/the-historical-sun-tzu\">历史上的孙子</a>与<a href=\"legend-and-history/life-shrouded-in-mystery\">笼罩谜团的一生</a>只<strong>标明</strong>孙武真实性、作者权等疑点并给出证据分级；这些公案的<strong>完整论证与反驳</strong>在<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a>展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷三章脉络\">本卷三章脉络</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[第一章 春秋的乱世] --&gt; B[第二章 仕吴的经历]&#10;  B --&gt; C[第三章 传说与史实]&#10;  A1[时代舞台] -.-&gt; A&#10;  A2[出身与成长] -.-&gt; A&#10;  B1[见吴王阖闾] -.-&gt; B&#10;  B2[献书·教战·破楚] -.-&gt; B&#10;  C1[已知: 证据链] -.-&gt; C&#10;  C2[未知: 谜团清单] -.-&gt; C\">graph LR\n  A[第一章 春秋的乱世] --&gt; B[第二章 仕吴的经历]\n  B --&gt; C[第三章 传说与史实]\n  A1[时代舞台] -.-&gt; A\n  A2[出身与成长] -.-&gt; A\n  B1[见吴王阖闾] -.-&gt; B\n  B2[献书·教战·破楚] -.-&gt; B\n  C1[已知: 证据链] -.-&gt; C\n  C2[未知: 谜团清单] -.-&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章</th>\n<th>篇目</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一 春秋的乱世</td>\n<td><a href=\"spring-and-autumn-era/the-warring-times\">春秋的乱世</a></td>\n<td>礼崩乐坏、战争升级、思想激荡的时代舞台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一 春秋的乱世</td>\n<td><a href=\"spring-and-autumn-era/a-strategist-is-born\">军事家的诞生</a></td>\n<td>三易其姓的将门家世、奔吴、隐居著书</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二 仕吴的经历</td>\n<td><a href=\"serving-the-state-of-wu/meeting-king-helu\">见吴王阖闾</a></td>\n<td>阖闾求贤、伍子胥七荐、君臣结盟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二 仕吴的经历</td>\n<td><a href=\"serving-the-state-of-wu/the-art-of-war-presented\">献兵法十三篇</a></td>\n<td>献书—吴宫教战—柏举破楚的完整证明链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三 传说与史实</td>\n<td><a href=\"legend-and-history/the-historical-sun-tzu\">历史上的孙子</a></td>\n<td>《史记》、《左传》沉默、银雀山汉简、证据分级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三 传说与史实</td>\n<td><a href=\"legend-and-history/life-shrouded-in-mystery\">笼罩谜团的一生</a></td>\n<td>生卒、籍贯、结局、与伍子胥关系四大谜团</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>按时间线读</strong>（推荐新手）：第一章 → 第二章 → 第三章，先建立「时代—人物—事功」的完整叙事，最后再进入史实考辨。</li>\n<li><strong>从史实切入读</strong>（推荐研究者）：先读第三章<a href=\"legend-and-history/the-historical-sun-tzu\">历史上的孙子</a>的「证据分级」表，带着「哪些可信」的标尺回头读前两章，避免被传说情节误导。</li>\n<li><strong>承上启下</strong>：读完本卷，建议接<a href=\"../major-works/\">4 代表成就</a>（认识他写的书），再到<a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a>与<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a>（理解书里的思想）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置与基调\">前置与基调</h2><p>本卷无硬性前置知识，但对春秋诸侯格局（周王室、齐、吴、楚、越的关系）有基本了解会更顺畅；第一章<a href=\"spring-and-autumn-era/the-warring-times\">春秋的乱世</a>已自带必要背景。全卷基调是「<strong>叙事 + 考辨双线并行</strong>」：既讲一个引人入胜的兵圣故事，又对每个关键情节标注史料可靠度，让读者既能享受传奇，又不被传奇误导。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spring-and-autumn-era","title":"春秋乱世","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-era","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-warring-times","title":"春秋的乱世","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-era/the-warring-times"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-strategist-is-born","title":"军事家的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-era/a-strategist-is-born"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"serving-the-state-of-wu","title":"仕吴","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/serving-the-state-of-wu","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"meeting-king-helu","title":"见吴王阖闾","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/serving-the-state-of-wu/meeting-king-helu"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-art-of-war-presented","title":"献兵法十三篇","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/serving-the-state-of-wu/the-art-of-war-presented"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"legend-and-history","title":"传说与史实","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/legend-and-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-historical-sun-tzu","title":"历史上的孙子","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/legend-and-history/the-historical-sun-tzu"},{"seq":2,"slug":"life-shrouded-in-mystery","title":"笼罩谜团的一生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/legend-and-history/life-shrouded-in-mystery"}]}]}